# FastAPI Cloud uploads what .gitignore allows, refined by this file (docs: how-it-works). The built frontend is
# gitignored (it's a build artifact), so the public deploy must be made from a workspace where it has been built:
#   (cd web && VITE_CATCH_DEPLOYMENT=public … npm run build) && fastapi deploy
# Whether a `!` re-include here overrides .gitignore is not documented — docs/public-setup.md says how to check.
!catch/api/static/
# Never ship these to the cloud app:
.env
.env.*
data/
backups-from-pi/
deploy/
web/node_modules/
web/test-results/
tests/
docs/
*.db
*.db-*
